+String
+coin
+nSigFigs
+Number
+Optional field to aggregate levels to
+nSigFigs
+significant figures. Valid values are 2, 3, 4, 5, and
+null
+, which means full precision
+mantissa
+Number
+Optional field to aggregate levels. This field is only allowed if nSigFigs is 5. Accepts values of 1, 2 or 5.
+Response
+200: OK
+Candle snapshot
+POST
+https://api.hyperliquid.xyz/info
+Only the most recent 5000 candles are available
+Supported intervals: "1m", "3m", "5m", "15m", "30m", "1h", "2h", "4h", "8h", "12h", "1d", "3d", "1w", "1M"
+Headers
