+"application/json"
+Body
+Name
+Type
+Description
+type
+*
+String
+"candleSnapshot"
+req
+*
+Object
+{"coin": <coin>, "interval": "15m", "startTime": <epoch millis>, "endTime": <epoch millis>}
+For HIP-3, you need to prefix with the dex name, e.g. "xyz:XYZ100"
+Response
+200: OK
